uling and review-board cadence are\n45\texternally controlled and cannot be compressed by engineering effort.\n46\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9e67aeb2862003e2","agent_id":"aaf90b27098152701","session_id":"f6f494ff-e064-4d81-8a07-c93e866aadc4","uuid":"e48c219e-e7f0-4d12-b995-1c73ca8d48c2","timestamp":"2026-10-21T16:09:19.946Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-85bcbe36b70a8c88","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Revise RHAISTRAT-9013 decomposition"}
