vior on a FIPS-enabled OpenShift cluster\n51\t- Confirm no functional regression on non-FIPS clusters\n52\t\n53\t## Acceptance Criteria\n54\t\n55\t- No Platform Operator image contains non-validated crypto in the request path,\n56\t  verified by binary/library inspection\n57\t- The operator reconciles the serving stack correctly on a FIPS-enabled\n58\t  OpenShift cluster\n59\t- No functional regression on non-FIPS clusters\n60\t- Rollback: the pre-remediation image builds remain available and deployable,\n61\t  so a cluster affected by a regression can revert to the previous image\n62\t  versions\n63\t- Build pipeline is green for all remediated images (per the component's\n64\t  confirmed pipeline status)\n65\t\n66\t## HLR Traceability\n67\t\n68\t- HLR-1 (P0): all serving-stack images run correctly on FIPS-enabled clusters\n69\t  using validated crypto modules\n70\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9ace5612da984093","agent_id":"acd2df83908752a59","session_id":"f6f494ff-e064-4d81-8a07-c93e866aadc4","uuid":"695ae019-e351-4b0e-bbb7-a249c9e393c2","timestamp":"2026-10-21T16:15:30.064Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-95ec6e9df0f1e7e5","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-9013 decomposition"}
