diated\n51\t  serving stack\n52\t- Assemble the package in the format required by the security review board and\n53\t  the certification lab\n54\t- Shepherd the package through security review board sign-off milestones and\n55\t  submit it to the external lab\n56\t\n57\t## Acceptance Criteria\n58\t\n59\t- Module inventory covers every serving-stack image in scope\n60\t- Build attestations exist for all remediated images\n61\t- FIPS-mode test results are included\n62\t- The package passes security review board sign-off at the defined milestones\n63\t- The package is submitted to the external certification lab\n64\t- Lab scheduling and review-board cadence are externally controlled and cannot\n65\t  be compressed by engineering effort; submission timing is a schedule risk,\n66\t  not a work-scope item\n67\t\n68\t## HLR Traceability\n69\t\n70\t- HLR-2 (P0): compliance evidence package (module inventory, build\n71\t  attestations, test results) assembled and submitted through the security\n72\t  review board to the external certification lab\n73\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9ace5612da984093","agent_id":"acd2df83908752a59","session_id":"f6f494ff-e064-4d81-8a07-c93e866aadc4","uuid":"3620a539-1acf-4dc0-a6da-aa24a5e39dff","timestamp":"2026-10-21T16:15:34.639Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-8f93e0db4cf54aa4","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-9013 decomposition"}
